; Used only by the Jenkinsfile's Release stage (NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=.npmrc.publish).
; npm expands ${NPM_TOKEN} from the environment when it reads this file; it is never the
; repository's default .npmrc, so an unset NPM_TOKEN breaks nothing but publishing.
//registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
; Snapshot and release registries (Nexus / Artifactory style), selected by branch in
; scripts/release.js via NPM_SNAPSHOT_REGISTRY / NPM_RELEASE_REGISTRY. Placeholders:
; //nexus.example.org/repository/npm-snapshots/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
; //nexus.example.org/repository/npm-releases/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
